DESCRIPTION:Out of Stock\n      \n    \n\n\n\n\n\nStone Wrapping\n\n  \n  
   \n      \n        \n          $145.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nSto
 ne Wrapping Saturday\, November 21st 10:00am-3:00pm $125.00 + $20.00 Mater
 ials fee In this class\, students will be creating decorative stones\, uti
 lizing wrapping techniques that can be applied outside of this class. Stud
 ents will learn 3 basic knots with time allotted between each lesson for s
 tudents to experiment creating new stones with the new knot. This approach
  allows everyone’s imagination to run wild\, fostering creativity and al
 lowing time for new ideas. All materials provided. Students often make 6-8
  stones per class. There will be discussion breaks\, and a lunch break thr
 oughout the class. Please bring water and a paper bag lunch. About the Tea
 cher: Carrie Botto is a self taught multi-medium weaver. She started weavi
 ng with beads over 40 years ago and continues to add skills and techniques
  to her “tool box”. Carrie travels all over the country now teaching s
 everal different classes\, and has taught at Mendocino Art Center\, New Me
 xico Bead Trader\, Moab Art Center\, and Fiber on 4th in New Mexico. Follo
 w Carrie on Instagram @beanstreetsudio! \n\n\n\n\n\n          \n          
   \n              \n                Add to cart
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 
 95472
URL:https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/stone-wrapping
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
