UID:261111wwHVO1SqU0m_OcYKpwWkHw
DESCRIPTION:Café Italiano - A free Italian language meetup. Practice • 
 Speak • Meet • Enjoy\n\nParli Italiano? Conversazione cultura amicizia
  caffe. Tutti sono i benvenuti!\n\nJoin us for a casual afternoon of Itali
 an conversation\, open to native speakers and anyone learning Italian\, as
  a way to practice and use the language.\n\nFree coffee and snacks!
