 sonates deeply with her fans. Whether you’re drawn by her unique story\,
  her radiant voice and presence\, or the soul-stirring synergy of her band
 \, a SIMRIT concert is a transformational experience.\n\n**Saturday\, Nove
 mber 21st\, at 7:30PM.** Doors open at 6:30 PM.\n\n**Front Row:** $79\n\n*
