DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy live music by DJ Rick Lee\, artist performances\, a
 nd community entertainment! Our goal is to give away at least 150 turkeys 
 to local families in need!\n\nWe’re calling on local businesses\, sponso
 rs\, and community members to help make this possible. Every donation coun
 ts\, whether it's a turkey\, monetary contribution\, or supplies!\n\nDONAT
 E TODAY - Cash App: $noblecinema\, Venmo: @noblecinema\n\nEveryone is welc
 ome to enjoy the festivities\, but the food and turkey giveaways are inten
 ded for families facing financial hardship and those experiencing homeless
 ness. If you're able to provide for your family this holiday season\, plea
 se leave these resources for neighbors who truly need them.\n\nProudly sup
 ported by East Vallejo Community Connection\, B’Santi Cleaning & Vacatio
 n Rental Management\, and our fellow community sponsors.\n\nGive what you 
 can\, share this event\, and help us make a difference for Vallejo familie
 s!
LOCATION:Noble Cinema Studios
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2081963495717392/
