X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Grounded: A Balance + Stability Workshop at Cabuya Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T153000
UID:2611203mvJez5tTEKBhJtsckE0ig
DESCRIPTION:Grounded: A Balance \\+ Stability Workshop with Stephanie – 
 $45\n\nCabuya Yoga \\+ Fitness • Santa Rosa\, CA | Sunday\, Nov 22 • 0
 2:00 PM – 03:30 PM PST\n\nwith Stephanie Koffler\n\nThe Sunday before Th
 anksgiving\, give yourself somewhere steady to stand.\n\nWho it’s for: A
 ll levels. No advanced experience needed\, just curiosity and a sense of p
 lay.\n\nThe holidays have a way of pulling us off center. Travel\, family\
 , full calendars\, and everyone wanting a piece of you. This workshop is n
 inety minutes to find your footing first\, in your body and in your head\,
  before the season sweeps you up.\n\nWe’ll treat balance as something yo
 u build\, not something you either have or don’t. Through strength\, mob
 ility\, breath\, and focus\, Stephanie will take it apart piece by piece a
 nd help you put it back together.\n\nExpect a practice that’s equal part
 s play and challenge. You’ll start with balances that feel familiar\, th
 en work toward harder ones like warrior 3 variations and revolved half moo
 n\, linked by slow\, creative transitions. You’ll experiment with where 
 you look\, how you breathe\, and where your weight sits\, and feel how muc
 h each one changes. Every posture has an easier and a harder way in\, so y
 ou choose your challenge as you go.\n\nBecause it’s a workshop\, you get
  more of Stephanie than a regular class allows: one-on-one coaching\, hand
 s-on assists with your consent\, and modifications built around how your b
 ody moves.\n\nWe’ll come down to the floor for a grounding sequence\, th
 en take time to talk\, ask questions\, and share what came up. You’ll le
 ave steadier than you arrived\, with a few tools to carry into the weeks a
 head.\n\nMats\, blocks\, and props provided.
LOCATION:Cabuya Yoga + Fitness
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/grounded-a-balance-stability-wor
 kshop-at-cabuya-yoga/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
