 ays | 2:30pm to 3:30pm<br />  In the Disability Cultural Center (3rd floor
  landing\, Bertolini Student Center)</p><p><a href="https://drd.santarosa.
 edu/dcc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information\, visit the D
 isability Cultural Center website.</a></p>
