DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the magic of Christmas with an elevated holiday dinn
 er at Ember. Our signature steakhouse sets the table for a memorable four-
 course experience\, pairing the richness of the season with Ember’s refi
 ned culinary style. Begin with inspired starters before choosing from cele
 bratory entrées including prime rib or crispy Mount Lassen trout\, follow
 ed by an indulgent holiday dessert. Settle in\, raise a glass\, and savor 
 Christmas in the heart of Merry Meritage.
