SUMMARY:Seb El Zin + Orion Rush
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T193000
UID:261115xunqYOcNjUuQPenUn7SwNg
DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm.\n\nShow from 8:15-10
 :30pm with one intermission\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each ticket when you 
 use the code earlybird21 at checkout. Offer ends November 22nd.\n\nProm
 o Codes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\
 , but must be typed as one word.\n\nBetween infra-bass\, Byzantine music\,
  and cyberpunk\, Seb El Zin achieves a great leap that restores a taste fo
 r music. By merging electro-dance and transe with music straight from a fu
 turistic Ottoman Orient\, the founder of the cult band Anarchist Republic 
 of Bzzz and member of Ithak restores confidence in the future of popular m
 usic. \n\nSeb El Zin propels cyber punk to the confines of tribal music\,
  accompanied in live shows\, by his army of drones\, synths\, drum machine
 s and sequencers\, to improvise and compose with the trance of the moment.
 \n\nhttps://linktr.ee/sebelzin\n\nOrion Rush is a multi instrumentalist si
 nger-songwriter blending hard hitting acoustic songs that hold listeners i
 n suspended moments of time with captivating live looping that fuses dance
 \, goth\, indie\, and experimental textures. Moving between intimacy and c
 haos\, Orion Rush creates immersive performances that can leave audiences 
 both on the edge of their seat and on their feet.\n\nhttps://on.soundcloud
 .com/nss4fcJX88r4w61LXj \n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/orionrushmusic
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 0000DtgQXMAZ
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
