X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:2026 ACORN MUSH BLUES FESTIVAL
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T210000
UID:261120QlJ8ea-4sk-iCg0bK6XILw
DESCRIPTION:American blues and roots music is treasured by all\, and certa
 inly in the Native American community as well. The Acorn Mush Blues Festiv
 al highlights local native musicians and artists who over the years crafte
 d their own style of that music. Just as acorns are gathered and processed
  into a fine delicious meal\, so is the music. Weaving Blues\, country\, r
 ock\, pop\, Jazz\, and R&B with our traditional native music.\n\nPomo Cult
 ural series - Presented by the Lake County Arts Council
LOCATION:Soper Reese Theatre
URL:http://soperreesetheatre.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
