SUMMARY:Meet Me in St. Louis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T153000
UID:261112XTwe5-zoCkCgBC8FWN78OA
DESCRIPTION:Meet Me in St. Louis is a heartwarming\, nostalgic musical tha
 t brings the charm and excitement of turn-of-the-century America to life. 
 Set in 1904 on the eve of the St. Louis World’s Fair\, the story follows
  the Smith family through a year of romance\, humor\, and unexpected chang
 e. At its center is the spirited and lovestruck Esther Smith\, whose bloss
 oming romance unfolds alongside her sisters’ own adventures and the fami
 ly’s hopes for the future. Featuring beloved songs like “The Trolley S
 ong\,” “Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\,” and “The Boy Nex
 t Door\,” this classic musical overflows with warmth\, wit\, and unforge
 ttable melodies. Rich with period detail\, lively ensemble numbers\, and t
 ender family moments\, Meet Me in St. Louis celebrates community\, resilie
 nce\, and the enduring power of home. Audiences will be swept up in its co
 lorful seasonal settings—from summer dances to a magical Christmas Eve
 —culminating in the dazzling anticipation of the World’s Fair. Perfect
  for theatregoers of all ages\, this timeless musical offers romance\, lau
 ghter\, and a joyful reminder that even in times of change\, love and fami
 ly light the way forward. MEET ME IN ST. LOUIS is presented by arrangement
  with Concord Theatricals on behalf of Tams-Witmark LLC. concordtheatrical
 s.com
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1599145155293030/1599145215293024/?act
 ive_tab=about
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus", "Press Democrat": "https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T143000
UID:261023Ns89U2R0Qka-22hf4GvT1A
DESCRIPTION:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly origin
 al\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and at
 hletically stunning skill.\n\nSonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 – This
  2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La Lune Bril
 le’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the intimate an
 d charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the Winter moon
  and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the sky\, she m
 ust find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she encounters
  mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child pleasing 
 origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acrobats\, and
  clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere with celest
 ial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages.\n\n
 Spectators for all showings are invited to the European style circus tent 
 to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Cornerstone Son
 oma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \n\nThe eve
 nt will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half hour show
 .\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Cornerstone Sono
 ma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase online at
