DESCRIPTION:Thotty’s Naughty Revue is Sebastopol’s monthly burlesque\,
  pole dance\, and variety show\, featuring a rotating lineup of talented l
 ocal and traveling performers. Enjoy an intimate\, up-close evening of gla
 mour\, sensual dance\, incredible pole artistry\, and the art of the tease
 . In collaboration with Wax Poetic\, the night continues with curated viny
 l\, vintage-cool vibes\, mingling\, and dancing. Come for the show\, stay 
 for the music\, and make a night of it! **November performers:** Tina Kris
 tine\, Kim\, Vylet Vanse\, Shiree Amour\, Wilee Walrus\, Audrey Jane\, Cou
 ntess Malfaz\, and Twerk A Rella.
