 on\, or you can arrange to have it delivered. Trees can also be purchased 
 online at https://lomavistafarm.org/shop  \n\nLoma Vista Farm is a five
 -acre outdoor classroom in North Vallejo that provides children with hands
 -on educational activities with plants and animals. All proceeds from the 
 sale will go toward animal care and improvements to the farm.
