BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/a-very-merry-weekend-2/", "Press Democrat": "https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/a-very-merry-weekend-2/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/a-very-merry-weekend-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:A Very Merry Weekend
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T180000
UID:261116GKk4BpUyr0a8kMuIel0tow
DESCRIPTION:Join us for A Very Merry Weekend at Montgomery Village!\n\nCel
 ebrate the season with a weekend of exclusive retail offerings\, family-fr
 iendly entertainment\, festive trimmings at every turn\, and more.\n\nFrid
 ay\, November 27:\n\nLive holiday music from 12pm-2pm in The Courtyard\, c
 ourtesy of Jimmy Galvan.\n\nHoliday caroling from 3:30pm to 5:30pm across 
 property\, courtesy of Silver Belles Caroling Group.\n\nSaturday\, Novembe
 r 28:\n\nWeekend Santa Sightings begin! Photos with Santa take place in Th
 e Courtyard on weekends from Saturday\, November 28 to Sunday\, December 2
 0\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily. Appointments are highly recommended. A portio
 n of proceeds from Weekend Santa Sightings benefit Sonoma County Secret Sa
 nta Program. Book your spot here.\n\nCelebrate Small Business Saturday by 
 supporting local small businesses across the Village.\n\nCelebrate the sea
 son at our Second Annual Tree Lighting Celebration on Saturday\, November 
 28\, from 5–7 p.m. in The Courtyard!\n\nEnjoy a festive evening filled w
 ith holiday music\, creative activities\, and a special appearance by Sant
 a and Mrs. Claus. Admission is free\, with seasonal fun for the whole fami
 ly:\n\nLive holiday music and carolers\, plus a family-friendly holiday si
 ngalong at 6:45 p.m.\n\n- Complimentary hot cocoa\n\n- Churros and cookies
  available for purchase\n\n- Complimentary caricature portraits\n\n- Custo
 m wood-burned gift tags\n\n- Make-your-own mini snowmen and jingle bell wr
 eath ornaments\n\n- Write your letters to Santa\, delivered through the of
 ficial Montgomery Village Santa Mail mailbox\n\n- A special visit from San
 ta and Mrs. Claus\n\n- Make the evening a little sweeter with a stop at Sa
 lt & Straw. During the event\, enjoy a complimentary scoop with the purcha
 se of a scoop\, available November 28\, 2026\, from 5–7 p.m.\n\nSunday\,
  November 29:\n\nLive holiday music in The Courtyard\n\nABOUT SONOMA COUNT
 Y SECRET SANTA\n\nSonoma County’s Secret Santa is a nonprofit gift-givin
 g program\, providing gifts and holiday cheer to those less fortunate in o
 ur community.\n\nSecret Santa has been bringing joy to people throughout S
 onoma County for over 30 years\, ensuring that children\, teens\, adults\,
  and seniors who would not otherwise receive a holiday gift have reason to
  celebrate and experience the compassion and generosity of their community
 .
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/a-very-merry-weekend-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
