SUMMARY:AHA BLS Certification Class (Blended Learning)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T123000
UID:260920pmPI0fyXekC50wtK1bYP1A
DESCRIPTION:AHA BLS Certification Class \\(Blended Learning\\)\n\nBLS Blen
 ded Learning / BLS Skills Session\n\nAHA BLS certification course for heal
 thcare providers. Blended Learning consists of an online course followed b
 y an in-person Skills Session. This American Heart Association Basic Life 
 Support class includes skills testing of cardiac and respiratory arrest ma
 nagement\, CPR\, AED use\, and choking treatment for all ages.\n\nAmerican
  Heart Association BLS Provider certifications are issued on the same day.
 \n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company with over 1\,000 5
 -star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and expertly taught by exp
 erienced first responders.\n\nLEARN MORE and ENROLL: https://vivecpr.com/c
 lass/heartcode-bls/\n\nCONTACT US: \\(707\\) 612-3277
LOCATION:Vive CPR
URL:https://vivecpr.com/class/heartcode-bls/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Jumpstart Your Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T160000
UID:260629mj28vB7Js0W8U1u0U3DABw
DESCRIPTION:Every person experiences an ebb and flow to the tides of their
  creativity. We will share space together to design\, exchange ideas\, and
  hold ourselves accountable to our unique interests! The first portion of 
 our time together will involve a check-in discussion of ‘what is'\, lead
 ing into ‘what could be'. The talk will be facilitated by Erin Partridge
 \, an art therapist with a long history of supporting people in reengaging
  with creativity. After our initial talk\, we will have some time to indiv
 idually focus on our creative practices in the space of the gallery. Befor
 e we close\, we will share anything that came up in the process. Bring you
 r ideas\, a project\, and an interest in creative community. Please be min
 dful of what you choose to show up with-something quiet\, easy to clean up
 \, and non-disruptive to your fellow creatives. Not sure where to begin? S
 ome basic materials are available\, thanks to a donation from  Blick Art M
 aterials . Open for all ages-youth under 12 with an adult chaperone please
 ! Mondays\, 1-4 PM Facilitator: Erin Partridge
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
