 hands-on wreath-making workshop! Using fresh seasonal greenery\, ribbon\, 
 and a variety of decorative accents\, you'll design and create your own be
 autiful holiday wreath. You'll be guided step-by-step through the wreath-m
 aking process while having plenty of creative freedom to personalize your 
 design and make it uniquely yours. No experience necessary\; all materials
  and instruction are included. Come enjoy a creative night out and leave w
 ith a handmade holiday wreath ready to display on your door or enjoy throu
 ghout the season.  Read More \\>
