SUMMARY:Sound Studio Basics - Rincon Valley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T103000
UID:ea9cb8688c6f64f52576c2197e49a5f5@sonomalibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Get started recording a song\, podcast\, or story using Garage
 Band. Learn the basics of how to use the hardware and software in the soun
 d studio. Advanced registration required. Maximum of 3 participants.
