UID:260805CDut20zankCONSIZCF7whA
DESCRIPTION:Bring your instrument\, your voice\, and join us for a fun eve
 ning of music\, comedy\, and spoken word.\n\nThe Host is Randy Foisy\, a t
 alented rhythm guitarist and vocalist with an extensive repertoire of cove
 rs from the 60's\, 70's\, 80's\, 90's and beyond\, and is also a popular s
 inger/songwriter.\n\n"Randy's Ear Candy " is his weekly radio show streami
 ng on KSVY.org\, and live at 91.3 FM\, Saturdays 5:00p-7:00p\, with rock n
 ' roll deep cuts\, reggae\, and jam bands.\n\nRandy has been hosting Open 
 Mics in Calistoga for over 30 years and is excited to host an Open Mic in 
 Sonoma.
LOCATION:Lily's Outpost
URL:http://lilysoutpost.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
