 ge ornaments\, brand new stationery items\, stocking stuffers\, ornament g
 rab bags\, shells and crystals\, silver-plate flatware\, and more!**\n\nTh
 is event will take place rain or shine. Please bring your own shopping bag
 s if possible. All the items were donated and all proceed benfit hospice g
