 of Canine Companions trades its training vests for Santa hats. Join us Dec
 ember 5th and 6th at Western Farm Center in Santa Rosa for Santa Paws\, ou
 r annual holiday celebration. Bring your pets and loved ones and take a ph
 oto with Santa Claus. Each photo costs $25 and all proceeds support the mi
 ssion of Canine Companions: providing service dogs to individuals with dis
 abilities at no cost to them.
