SUMMARY:Holiday Paella in the Cellar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T190000
UID:241d9a282b01f0aab9ed0d75aa2c7a1e@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us this holiday season for a festive paella luncheon in o
 ur charming wine cellar\, beautifully decorated with twinkling lights to s
 et the perfect holiday ambiance. Indulge in Marimar’s famous paella\, pe
 rfectly paired with our selection of wines. Enjoy a delicious spread of Sp
 anish tapas before diving into the main course.
