DESCRIPTION:Seasonal Classics\, festive favorites from the great American 
 Christmas songbook\, and sparkling orchestral treats\, including Duke Elli
 ngton’s dazzling take on *The Nutcracker*.\n\nMarc Taddei\, Music Direct
 or. Soloists\, Tiffany Austin\, Joe Bagale and the American Canyon High Sc
 hool Chamber Choir\, Jamie Butler\, director.\n\nTiffany Austin is a Vocal
 ist\, Composer and Educator. The LA Native now resides in the Bay Area and
  has toured internationally and appeared in film and television. Joe Bagal
 e - Singer-songwriter Joe Bagale brings a soulful blend of R&B and rock to
  the San Francisco music scene.
LOCATION:Hogan Auditorium
