X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://secure.qgiv.com/for/jcwzbq/event/adobecreek/", "Press Democrat": "https://secure.qgiv.com/for/jcwzbq/event/adobecreek/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://secure.qgiv.com/for/jcwzbq/event/adobecreek/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Reimagining the Rain in Adobe Creek
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T193000
UID:261116y1m7V99NGkObCdeD6rpCQw
DESCRIPTION:Si hablas español\, habrá un intérprete en este evento. Ind
 ícanoslo en el último paso al inscribirte en el evento.\n\nWhat would it
  look like if our neighborhoods were designed to work with and welcome wat
 er instead of sending it away?\n\nAs a part of our Harvest the Rain Pilot 
 Program\, Daily Acts is inviting Petaluma community members who live near
  or are frequent visitors in the Adobe Creek area to REIMAGINE THE RAIN 
 by attending an interactive\, neighborhood-based community input session.\
 n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\
 _\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\
 \_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_
 \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\
 _\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nJoin this
  Community Input Session to:\n\n-Help us understand your experience with s
 tormwater\n\n-Learn from local experts in our community\n\n-Connect with y
 our neighbors over FREE dinner\n\n-Provide feedback on DIY rain garden and
  curb cut templates\n\n-Enter a gift card drawing for local businesses li
 ke The Seed Bank\, Caffeine Inc.\, and Refill Mercantile\n\nDuring the ses
 sion\, we'll discuss how we can work with rainwater to build resilient nei
 ghborhoods. We’ll hear from you to learn where you’ve noticed water po
 oling in your neighborhood\, and explore whether those places are creating
  challenges\, or if they could be the beginning of an opportunity to work 
 with water in an exciting new way! We will also gather your feedback on th
 e rain garden and curb-cut landscape templates we’re developing. \n\n\\
 _\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\
 \_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_
 \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\
 _\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\
 \_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nlf you live ne
 ar or frequent Adobe Creek\, we want to hear from you!\n\nCome share you
 r observations\, what you’d like to see in your neighborhood\, and any q
 uestions\, excitement or concerns you may have about this pilot program. W
 e hope to see you there!\n\nQuestions? Please email moreinfo@dailyacts.or
 g or call \\(707\\) 200-8364
LOCATION:Petaluma Community Center
URL:https://secure.qgiv.com/for/jcwzbq/event/adobecreek/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
