SUMMARY:Jolly Jamboree
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T170000
UID:261116lP_uUsCTUU-JAWT8zsj4vQ
DESCRIPTION:🎄 Enjoy a magical\, casual holiday celebration with family
  and friends at Cornerstone Sonoma’s Jolly Jamboree. 🎄\n\nJoin us fo
 r a festive celebration filled with holiday cheer\, seasonal shopping\, de
 licious food\, and joyful moments with family and friends.\n\nStroll throu
 gh the beautiful grounds of Cornerstone Sonoma\, discover unique gifts fro
 m local artisans and vendors\, enjoy festive bites and beverages\, and soa
 k in the magic of the holiday season.\n\nWhether you’re searching for th
 e perfect holiday gift\, planning a festive outing with friends\, or creat
 ing special memories with your little ones\, Jolly Jamboree is the perfect
  place to celebrate!\n\n🎁 Highlights\n\nFamily & Pet Friendly – All
  ages welcome.\n\nLive Music & Dancing – Square dancing\, Bluegrass ban
 d\, Line dancing\n\nHoliday Shopping – Discover one-of-a-kind gifts\, h
 andcrafted treasures\, and seasonal favorites from local vendors.\n\nSip &
  Savor – Enjoy delicious seasonal bites\, wine\, and festive refreshmen
 ts available for purchase.\n\nHoliday Memories – Gather your loved ones
  for a cheerful day filled with laughter\, shopping\, and celebration. Enj
 oy pony rides and photos with Santa.\n\nSupport Local – Shop small and 
 celebrate the talented makers\, artisans\, and businesses in our community
 .
LOCATION:Cornerstone Sonoma
URL:https://cornerstonesonoma.com/event/jolly-jamboree/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.summerfieldwaldorf.org/winter-faire/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Winter Faire Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T150000
UID:261115OndgLPbttkq3b9OYegsjSw
DESCRIPTION:Winter Faire for All: Saturday\, December 12\, 11am-3pm\n\nWe 
 warmly invite your whole family to join us for Summerfield Waldorf School 
 & Farm’s 43rd Annual Winter Faire! Winter Faire is open to Summerfield f
 amilies\, their guests\, and the greater community. Children’s crafting 
 is limited to the first 300 registrants\, so we encourage you to reserve y
 our spot early by following the website link.\n\nBring your family for a d
 ay of festive crafts\, holiday treats & shopping\, a Waldorf puppet show a
 nd more. Be sure to reserve your puppet show spot and purchase Winter Fair
 e currency by clicking the button below. Wander among local artisan vendor
 s offering unique\, handmade gifts\; enjoy a puppet show\, captivating sto
 rytelling\, live music\, delicious food and treats\, warm drinks\, and a c
 ozy bonfire. Children will delight in creating seasonal treasures through 
 traditional activities such as candle dipping\, candle holder making\, her
 b wreaths\, wool angels\, and wind spirals. And don’t forget the beloved
  Snowflake Shop\, where little shoppers can discover a special holiday gif
 t for someone they love!
LOCATION:Summerfield Waldorf School & Farm
URL:https://www.summerfieldwaldorf.org/winter-faire/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
