DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T120000
UID:261031uk3S1UK7bkSbyD-BiEdmBA
DESCRIPTION:We're thrilled to announce that Healdsburg Jazz is expanding 
 our Family Matinee Concert Series! This season\, we're growing from two co
 ncerts each year to five exciting interactive performances designed to i
 nspire curiosity\, creativity\, and a love of jazz in audiences of all age
 s.\n\nBest of all\, every Family Matinee concert is completely FREE\, mak
 ing it easy for children\, parents\, grandparents\, and music lovers of al
 l ages to experience world-class jazz together.\n\nPlease help us spread t
 he word! Because these concerts are offered free of charge\, we're relyi
 ng on our community to help us reach as many families as possible. Togethe
 r\, we can build a vibrant new tradition of family- oriented jazz experien
 ces in Sonoma County.\n\nRegistration is not required—walk-ins are welco
 me!
LOCATION:Healdsburg Community Church
