DESCRIPTION:**Met Opera Live in HD 25-26 Season**\n\nMOZART\n\n**THE MAGIC
  FLUTE**\n\n**Saturday\, December 12   11:00am**\n\n**Tony Award–winne
 r Julie Taymor conjures a spellbinding staging of Mozart’s enchanting op
