DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season at Keller Estate with a festive a
 fternoon of sparkling wines\, seasonal bites\, and live holiday carolers. 
 This annual gathering is the perfect opportunity for Wine Club members to 
 pick up their December club allocation while enjoying the warmth and cheer
  of the season. Reconnect with fellow members\, sip exceptional wines\, an
 d experience the magic of the holidays in the beautiful setting of Keller 
 Estate. Whether you're collecting your club wines or simply celebrating th
 e season\, this joyful event offers a memorable way to toast the holidays.
LOCATION:Keller Estate Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/holiday-celebration-at-keller-estate/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
