SUMMARY:Wine Club Member Holiday Party - 6th Annual Sweater Contest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T170000
UID:261112uQmr-nedJEW3CkEfX6_7Vw
DESCRIPTION:You're invited for some holiday cheer to celebrate this specia
 l time of year!  We'll have great wine\, food and entertainment for all to
  enjoy.  Taste through our current wine selection paired with delicious bi
 tes\, and dance the afternoon away!  And we look forward to seeing all the
  great Holiday Sweaters you've been dying to wear! Holiday Sweater Contest
 : Not required\, but for all those willing to participate\, we'll be holdi
 ng our Sixth Annual Contest with a chance to win 1st\, 2nd\, or 3rd place 
 prizes!   Wine: Wine specials will be offered to stock up for all your hol
 iday needs: parties\, gift giving\, holiday donations\, and personal consu
 mption too. Four Bottle Members can pick up their December release during 
 the event.  Entertainment: We're excited to have the Bay Area's D'Groove B
 and back at Vino Godfather. D'Groove's simple concept of playing the lates
 t dance tunes\, classic old school\, and favorite standards assures a good
  time for all on the dance floor! Food: La Strada Cucina Italiana will pro
 vide a delicious buffet of pastas\, side dishes\, salads and more! Locatio
 n: Large tents in backyard garden area. Dress accordingly.   Deadline to b
 uy tickets is Sunday December 6th! ADVANCE TICKET PRICES: Case Club Member
  Price: $45 Wine Club Member Price: $55 Member For A Day: $75 TICKETS "AT 
 THE DOOR" ARE VERY LIMITED AND WILL BE $10 HIGHER\, SO PLEASE BUY IN ADVAN
 CE.  FRIENDS ARE WELCOME!
LOCATION:Vino Godfather
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1778688500100176/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
