DESCRIPTION:Broadway Holiday Returns This December! Our beloved holiday tr
 adition is back - with performances at Jackson Theater in Santa Rosa \\(De
 c 12-13\\) and a highly anticipated return to the Sebastiani Theatre in So
 noma \\(Dec 16-20\\)\, where last year's run sold out! Celebrate the seaso
 n with Broadway stars\, festive favorites\, and heartwarming moments. Plus
 \, Gold ticket holders at Jackson Theater at Sonoma County Day are invited
  to an exclusive pre-show reception\, while Gold ticket holders at Sebasti
 ani Theatre attendees can enjoy a post-show reception at The Zina Lounge a
 t Ledson Hotel. SANTA ROSA - Jackson Theater Saturday\, December 12 at 2:0
 0 p.m. and 7:00 p.m. Sunday\, December 13 at 2:00 p.m. Please read our "Th
 ings to Know" section near the bottom of the page for your Santa Rosa perf
 ormance! SONOMA - Sebastiani Theatre Wednesday\, December 16 at 7:00 p.m. 
 Thursday\, December 17 at 7:00 p.m. Friday\, December 18 at 7:00 p.m. Satu
 rday\, December 19 at 2:00 p.m. and 7:00 p.m. Sunday\, December 20 at 2:00
  p.m. Groups of 10 or more can save! Secure group tickets by filling out o
 urGroup Inquiries Form\, or call the box office at877-424-1414 ext. 2.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/broadway-holiday/
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
