SUMMARY:Holiday Shadowbox Ornaments Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa Creative Circle\n***(additional photos below)***\n\
 n**Turn a favorite photo into a keepsake ornament!**\n**In this festive wo
 rkshop you'll create two shadowbox ornaments — a beloved photo\, miniatu
 re figures\, glittering snow and holiday trims\, sealed in a sparkling fra
 me that's ready to hang on the tree. Make one for your tree and one to giv
 e\, or treasure them both.**\n**Bring a favorite small photo — family\, 
 a beloved pet\, a special moment — and we'll supply everything else: fra
 mes\, miniatures\, snow\, trims and all the sparkly bits.**\n**No experien
 ce needed\, just holiday spirit. The Arthaus is a welcoming\, judgement-fr
 ee studio — come disconnect for a few hours and leave with handmade keep
 sakes you'll bring out every December.**\n**Good to know:**\n**• All sup
 plies included — just bring your photo**\n**• Minimum 4 · Maximum 8 p
 articipants\, so reserve early**\n**• To reserve: RSVP here and submit y
 our $45 payment via Venmo**\n\n**@Elizabeth-Monaghan-12**\n**925-548-8077*
 *\n\n**— your seat is confirmed once payment is received**
