SUMMARY:Weekend Santa Sightings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
UID:261116O89HuWfxsU2XgVEi2ng7vA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holidays and join us at the Village for photos w
 ith Santa happening on weekends from Saturday\, November 28th to Sunday\, 
 December 20th\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily.\n\nAppointments are highly recomm
 ended\, as we cannot guarantee that we can accommodate all walk-ups throug
 hout the event series. Reserve your 5-minute window now for a $35 fee duri
 ng our initial release \\(through Friday\, November 13\\). Beginning Satur
 day\, November 14\, the fee increases to $45. Each family will receive a p
 rint to take home that day\, as well as a digital copy of their photo foll
 owing the appointment. Please note that we do not call or text waitlisted 
 guests.\\*\n\nMake the most of your Santa visit:\n\nYour photo package inc
 ludes up to five digital photos\, emailed the Monday following your appoin
 tment\, plus a print to take home that day.\n\nEnjoy writing letters to Sa
 nta and dropping them off at the official Montgomery Village Santa Mail ma
 ilbox\, plus crafts at our holiday craft tables.\n\nSweeten your visit! St
 op by Salt & Straw before or after your appointment and enjoy a compliment
 ary kids’ scoop with any ice cream purchase during Weekend Santa Sightin
 gs \\(valid each Saturday and Sunday from 11/28/26 to 12/20/26 between 11 
 a.m. to 3 p.m.\\).\n\nKeep an eye out for ME SPA’s elves\, spreading hol
 iday cheer and a little stress relief with special cards to redeem at the 
 spa. Bring yours in for a Chill Bag\, a holiday survival kit filled with g
 oodies and coupons to help you keep your cool all season long. For an extr
 a moment of relaxation\, enjoy a complimentary chair massage as scheduling
  allows.\n\nRetro Foto will be assisting in making this memory last a life
 time by providing Santa with a vintage ride for all to enjoy! Retro Foto i
 s Sonoma County’s boutique photo booth experience. Lola is a fully resto
 red 1970 Volkswagen bus that loves the camera – whether it’s as a phot
 o booth or a photo backdrop! Lola is all about making memories\, which is 
 why Santa thought this would be the perfect way to drive into the Holiday 
 season!\n\nBy attending this event\, guests consent to appear in photo/vid
 eo recordings that may be used for website photography or other purposes.\
 n\n\\*A portion of proceeds will benefit Sonoma County Secret Santa Progra
 m.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/weekend-santa-sightings/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
