DESCRIPTION:< Add a little magic to the season with a festive afternoon of
  Holiday Cookie Decorating Workshop and wine tasting at St. Francis Winery
  & Vineyards in Sonoma Wine Country. Guests will enjoy a warm holiday rece
 ption featuring mulled wine and seasonal bites\, followed by a guided cook
 ie-decorating experience led by Pastry Chef Marina Medan. Sip a curated ta
 sting of St. Francis Artisan Collection wines while creating beautifully d
 ecorated holiday cookies to take home-no experience required\, and all sup
 plies are provided. Celebrate the holidays in Sonoma Valley with wine\, cr
 eativity\, and seasonal charm.
LOCATION:St. Francis Winery & Vineyards
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/holiday-cookie-workshop-at-st-francis-win
 ery/
