SUMMARY:Annual Lucia Jul Fika with Linnea Lodge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T160000
UID:261106ycudYuuI6Uahr6hwR0gHIg
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Scandinavian holiday traditions with Linnea Lod
 ge!\n\nLinnea Lodge \\#504 invites Members\, families\, friends\, and thos
 e interested in Scandinavian holiday traditions to come participate in our
  annual Lucia Jul Fika.\n\nA Swedish "fika" is a break in the day to enjo
 y coffee and a treat. We're taking fika and adding our annual Santa Lucia 
 pageant and other Jul traditions for a day of cultural fellowship. Enjoy l
 ive music\, dancing around the tree\, a gift basket drawing\, and a specia
 l visit from Jultomten \\(Santa!\\) to complete the festivities.\\*\\*\n\n
 Coffee\, tea\, and soft drinks will be served\, along with sandwiches\, ch
 eese and crackerbread\, fruit\, cookies\, and traditional Swedish lussekat
 ter \\(saffron buns\\).\n\nWhat to bring:\n\n- Members: Please bring 1 sma
 ll Poinsettia for tables and a dozen cookies or a baked treat for our Fika
 \n\n- \\*\\*For everyone bringing children\, please bring a small wrapped 
 gift for each child in your party with their name printed clearly on the 
 package. \\(Drop off packages discretely at check in.\\)\n\nChildren part
 icipating in the pageant are asked to arrive at 1:30 PM for practice. Part
 icipating boys should wear black pants and a white shirt. Gowns provided.\
 n\nSeating is limited. Please RSVP by December 2nd.
LOCATION:Petaluma Veterans Memorial Building
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/swedish-lucia-fika
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
