DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T170000
UID:261120bGu4F_B8KUeyz68rJdcUqA
DESCRIPTION:The Bay Area's Favorite Swing Band at Sebastopol Hopmonk\n\nTh
 e Death and Taxes Swing Band is unavoidably swinging\, and they're bringin
 g their high energy 40's and 50's dance music to the Sebastopol Hopmonk on
  Dec. 13 for an all ages matinee show.\n\nAt this special event\, the afte
 rnoon will begin with a short beginner swing dance lesson. No partner need
 ed. Then the band will take the stage to swing their way through holiday f
 avorites. Jingle all the Way to the North Pole with holiday hits from the 
 big band era. At the Sebastopol Hopmonk there is a great wooden dance floo
 r and plenty of room to dance.
LOCATION:Hopmonk Sebastopol
URL:https://DeathAndTaxesSwingBand.com
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
