SUMMARY:HOLIDAY MOSAIC
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T170000
UID:261029fsoPCwhsfU2DDpzVzn5HWQ
DESCRIPTION:**Sing Napa Valley** presents *Holiday Mosaic*\, a festive and
  inspiring choral celebration of the seasons traditions throughout the US 
 and around the world. The program features Camille Saint-Saëns' beloved *
 Christmas Oratorio*\, performed with vocal soloists\, chorus\, organ\, str
 ings\, and harp\, alongside music honoring Canukah\, Kwanzaa\, Las Posadas
 \, the Winter Solstice\, and other holiday traditions.\n\nAudiences will e
 njoy spirited multicultural selections\, a holiday sing-along\, and a spec
 ial appearance from a familiar seasonal guest. Conducted by Ronnie Zanella
 \, the concert showcases Sing Napa Valley's 50-member intergenerational ch
 oir in a joyful celebration of community\, culture\, and the season
LOCATION:First United Methodist Church
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/holiday-mosaic-2
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
