X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Penngrove Holiday Lights Parade
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T190000
UID:261116XEJwc4j5fkC1hlH0Nflfew
DESCRIPTION:WHO: Penngrove Social Firemen present\n\nWHAT: Penngrove Holid
 ay Parade of Lights  - 11th Annual  \n\nWHEN: Sunday\, December 13\,
  2026\, from 6:00 pm – 7:00 pm\n\nWHERE: Downtown Penngrove along Main S
 t.\, \\(the parade forms at Penngrove Park\, 11800 Main Street\\)\n\nWHY: 
 Holiday cheer with lighted farm vehicles\n\nHoliday Parade of Lights – D
 ecember 13\, 2026\n\n Bundle up and come down to Main Street for the 11th
   annual Penngrove Holiday Parade of Lights on Sunday\, December 13\, f
 rom 6:00 PM to 7:00 PM. Penngrove Social Firemen sponsor the glammed-up tr
 actor-trailers\, farm vehicles\, and decorated farm tractors covered in li
 ghts. \n\n Local merchants will serve soup\, pizza\, hot cider\, and str
 eet food to keep you warm. The parade stages in Penngrove Park\, 11800 Ma
 in St.\, and rolls up Main Street toward Adobe Rd. Watch out for the tra
 in.\n\n Parade entries must register in advance and gather an hour early 
 at Penngrove Park. The entry fee is $20 on Parade night. To join the parad
 e\, download the entry form from https://www.penngrovesocialfiremen.organ
 d return it by December 10 to Penngrove Market or by email to mrsjjava@ho
 tmail.com . For information\, contact Kim Hanson at 707 318-2191.\n\nRoad
 s Close: 5:00 - 7:30 pm \n\nParking 4:30 - 8:00 pm at Penngrove Elementar
 y School\, Adobe Rd. & Petaluma Hill Road.\n\nPenngrove Social Firemen are
  a nonprofit 501 c3. The own and maintain the Penngrove Clubhouse and Penn
 grove Park\, and support community needs.
LOCATION:Downtown Penngrove
URL:https://www.penngrovesocialfiremen.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/winter-wonder-lantern-walks-at-sonoma-botanical-garden/2026-12-13/", "Press Democrat": "https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/lantern-walks/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/lantern-walks/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Winter Wonder Lantern Walks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T183000
UID:261023RBXc7FEg8Ea_ziLp_uW7rg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the beauty and quiet magic of the season during Wint
 er Wonder Lantern Walks\, a festive after-dark experience at Sonoma Botani
 cal Garden. Guided along the route by Garden staff and volunteers\, guests
  will stroll through the winter landscape carrying glowing lanterns\, disc
 overing softly shadowed pathways\, towering trees\, and the peaceful still
 ness of the Garden beneath the night sky. Rather than a traditional docent
 -led tour\, this experience is designed as a peaceful and immersive opport
 unity to enjoy the rare experience of walking through the Garden after hou
 rs and after dark. Along the way\, enjoy moments of reflection\, seasonal 
 ambiance\, and the simple joy of gathering outdoors during the holiday sea
 son.\n\nThe evening begins with hot cocoa\, spiced cider\, wine tasting an
 d cookies from 5:30–6:00 p.m.\, followed by a brief welcome and lantern 
 walk orientation before departing together for a guided walk through the G
 arden.\n\nWinter Wonder Lantern Walks are a seasonal fundraiser that will 
 support the Garden’s programs\, collections\, and conservation efforts. 
 PLEASE READ the important accessibility and experience information\, along
  with the registration and cancellation policy below before purchasing tic
 kets.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/lantern-walks/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
