DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Community Band presents its Winter Concert on Mon
 day\, Dec. 14\, 2026 at 7:30 pm\, Casa Grande High School multi-use room\,
  333 Casa Grande Rd\, Petaluma. Music includes "A Salute to American Jazz"
 \, with standards like "It Don't Mean a Thing"\; music from Fiddler on the
  Roof\; Zacatecas Mexican March\; Dancing at Stonehenge\, and a piece by E
 ric Ewazen featuring our bass trombonist Scott Thornton. All this and more
