DESCRIPTION:Every class at Culture Fitness in Rohnert Park on Thursday\, D
 ec. 17 is the 12 Days of Christmas Workout: like the song\, you add one mo
 vement each round until you've done all twelve. Pick any class: 5:00\, 6:0
 0\, 6:45\, 8:45 or 9:30 AM\, or 4:45\, 5:30 or 6:15 PM. It's free\, coach-
 led and open to everyone\, with no membership needed and every movement sc
 aled. Wear your ugliest Christmas sweater or a Santa hat\, and there's a p
 rotein cookie for everyone who comes. We're also running a toy drive for o
 ur local Rotary club\, so bring a new\, unwrapped toy if you can. Pick you
 r class at landingpage1.culturefitness.fit/12-days
