UID:261119CDtoXxZOH020ZlAQs57pfQ
DESCRIPTION:Santa photos and holiday visits return to Santa Rosa Plaza\, i
 nviting guests to experience one of the season’s most cherished traditio
 ns. Families can capture the perfect holiday photo\, enjoy festive activit
 ies and discover new ways to celebrate together at the mall.\n\nNew this y
