 g.jpg
CATEGORIES:Department Events
DESCRIPTION:As generative AI becomes embedded across disciplines\, higher 
 education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\, 
 but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities fo
 r research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depends en
 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Zack Darling is an award-winning 
 brand builder with decades of experience in strategy\, development\, exper
 iential design\, and fabrication.Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' 
 AI Talks website. (https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T190847Z
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23949-zack-darling-human-agency-m
 achine-inquiry
