DESCRIPTION:Join us Friday\, December 18th\, for a magical holiday evening
  at Jacuzzi Family Vineyards. Organist John Partridge will perform festive
  and inspiring music on our beautifully restored 1897 Bergstrom pipe organ
  in the stunning Barrel Room. Surrounded by the glow of candlelight and th
 e warmth of the season\, enjoy an unforgettable celebration of music\, win
 e\, and holiday spirit. Before the concert\, gather in our Piazza\, where 
 wine by the glass or bottle and pizzas will be available for purchase. Doo
 rs to the Barrel Room open at 5:45 p.m.\, and the concert begins at 6:00 p
 .m. Tickets are $10 and include a welcome glass of wine.
LOCATION:Jacuzzi Family Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/jacuzziwines/event/588511/organ-by-candlel
 ight-a-holiday-concert
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
