BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutcracker/", "Press Democrat": "https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutcracker/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutcracker/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Nutcracker Ballet by Dance Evolution Studios
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T180000
UID:261118asxDqWlmbUyBUGlRZnLlmA
DESCRIPTION:A professional-level presentation of Tchaikovsky’s classic N
 utcracker ballet with a spectacular community twist! Experience the timele
 ss magic of the holidays with Dance Evolution Studios (formerly Santa Rosa
  Dance Theater)! This beloved tradition tells the enchanting story of youn
 g Clara\, whose Christmas Eve dream unfolds into a world of swirling snowf
 lakes\, dancing sweets\, and unforgettable adventure.\n\nThis year’s pro
 duction elevates the tale with world-class talent and surprising new delig
 hts\, including:\n\n\\- A professional female magician\, Ari Rose Magic\, 
 bringing captivating spellwork to life as Auntie Drosselmeyer!\n\n\\- Star
 -Studded Guest Artists: Professional guest dancers—including former perf
 ormers with Dance Theater of Harlem and San Francisco Ballet. dancing alon
 gside the talented students of DES\n\n\\- Live Guest Musicians: Jeanette I
 senberg (second violinist with the Santa Rosa Symphony) and award-winning 
 pianist Robert Young\n\n\\- Community Legends: A special guest appearance 
 by the owners of Taylor Dance (formerly Nordquist Dance)\, performing as C
 lara’s parents and bringing a custom ballroom flair to the Party Scene!\
 n\nFrom exquisite choreography and lavish costumes to Tchaikovsky’s icon
 ic score\, it’s an extraordinarily rich\, family-friendly holiday experi
 ence!\n\nElevate Your Evening with VIP Tickets: Upgrade to VIP for an excl
 usive backstage tour and an elegant wine-and-charcuterie spread at intermi
 ssion. The perfect touch to make your Nutcracker night truly magical.
LOCATION:Spreckels Center for the Performing Arts
URL:https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutc
 racker/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/109075391?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Callie Watts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T180000
UID:261102nSbA9Udtd0qTwtauaUHo4A
DESCRIPTION:Callie Watts is a singer/songwriter from Northern California w
 ho was raised on classical music\, The Beatles and The Beach Boys before d
 iscovering Joni Mitchell\, Elton John\, Stevie Wonder\, Paul Simon\, Billy
  Joel\, Carole King\, and all the great writers of the ’60s and 70’s w
 ho have influenced her sound and writing style. After graduating high scho
 ol\, Callie began playing and performing solo\, as well as in local and ba
 y area bands of different genres. She’s played blues with Eric Lindell a
 nd the Reds\, funky soul with Phatty\, and jazz/swing with Savoy Swingers 
 along with many other various projects. Callie has taken turns throughout 
 her career as a keyboardist\, guitarist\, writer\, and lead/backing vocali
 st\, and she’s currently a member of the dynamic Sonoma County funk rock
  band Burrows and Dilbeck\, having joined in 2010 as part of the former ba
 nd Frobeck. Over time\, she’s had the honor of opening for acts such as 
 Bootsy Collins\, Elvin Bishop\, Huey Lewis and The News\, War\, Ozomatli\,
  Bill Champlin\, Booker T\, and the B52s. Callie continues to perform freq
 uently as an acoustic solo artist\, focusing on developing a core audience
  and a buzz for her original material. Come hang out and listen at venues 
 such as Aroma Roasters\, Rincon Valley Tap Room and Bottle Shop\, and Hopm
 onk Tavern.
LOCATION:Hotel Healdsburg
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/109075391?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
