BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Novel Lovers Of Sebastopol": "https://www.meetup.com/novel-lovers-of-sebastopol/events/316660559/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_novel_lovers_of_sebastopol
X-SOURCE:Novel Lovers of Sonoma County
UID:event_316660559@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261121T065133Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T143000
SUMMARY:Yesteryear by Caro Claire Burke (option 1)
DESCRIPTION:Novel Lovers of Sonoma County\, CA\nA modern day Christian tra
 dwife Natalie decides with her husband to take the family to live in a far
 mhouse\, grow their own food\, raise chickens and a cow\, and raise/home s
 chool their ever-increasing brood without modern influences. However -- mo
 m is also a social media influencer who videos everything... except the na
 nnies and farmworkers behind the scenes. She wakes up one day and she and 
 some version of her family are in a real farmhouse (with no helpers) in 18
 55! How to get out of this nightmare/delusion/time travel?\n\n"I found it 
 to be a realy page turner--couldn't put it down. I definitely think that w
 e should read this for our group. It's so unusual and I think it would pro
 vide fodder for very interesting discussion." - Nancy R.\n\n"For the life 
 of me\, I can’t figure out why I kept reading this book given that most 
 of the characters in it are deplorable. But I sure kept reading it. And th
 en when I finished it\, I wondered what kind of a person could write such 
 a book and I was surprised when I listened to the interview that the autho
 r is actually full-fledged human being with a heart and a sense of humor. 
 To me\, that the sign of someone with tremendous craft. There are many top
 ics in this book that I think would be a wealth for us to discuss: The dou
 ble lives of social media influencers\, Tradwife vs Girlboss\, can we go b
 ack into the way that used to be. I suspect the reason this book is so hot
  because it’s so topical." - Lucinda\n\n"It took me a bit to get into (I
  was just so annoyed at the beginning:) but after things began to develop\
 , I was hooked. A lot to discuss - although it may be tough to separate ou
 t discussion on the book itself and the real-world implications!" - Debra\
 n\n"[Why You Should Read ‘Yesteryear’ Now](https://www.nytimes.com/202
 6/05/10/briefing/yesteryear-caro-claire-burke.html?unlocked_article_code=1
 .01A.Gak9.SZGpJviEJq74&smid=url-share)" - NY Times\n\n"‘[Yesteryear’ i
 s this summer’s must-discuss book. We have questions.](https://www.washi
 ngtonpost.com/style/interactive/2026/06/18/yesteryear-is-this-summers-must
 -read-book-let-discuss/)" - Washington Post:
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/novel-lovers-of-sebastopol/events/316
 660559/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260922T053135Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260922T053135Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutcracker/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutcracker/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:The Nutcracker Ballet by Dance Evolution Studios
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T130000
UID:261118jHX7flg-70-49_bjf1c4uQ
DESCRIPTION:A professional-level presentation of Tchaikovsky’s classic N
 utcracker ballet with a spectacular community twist! Experience the timele
 ss magic of the holidays with Dance Evolution Studios (formerly Santa Rosa
  Dance Theater)! This beloved tradition tells the enchanting story of youn
 g Clara\, whose Christmas Eve dream unfolds into a world of swirling snowf
 lakes\, dancing sweets\, and unforgettable adventure.\n\nThis year’s pro
 duction elevates the tale with world-class talent and surprising new delig
 hts\, including:\n\n\\- A professional female magician\, Ari Rose Magic\, 
 bringing captivating spellwork to life as Auntie Drosselmeyer!\n\n\\- Star
 -Studded Guest Artists: Professional guest dancers—including former perf
 ormers with Dance Theater of Harlem and San Francisco Ballet. dancing alon
 gside the talented students of DES\n\n\\- Live Guest Musicians: Jeanette I
 senberg (second violinist with the Santa Rosa Symphony) and award-winning 
 pianist Robert Young\n\n\\- Community Legends: A special guest appearance 
 by the owners of Taylor Dance (formerly Nordquist Dance)\, performing as C
 lara’s parents and bringing a custom ballroom flair to the Party Scene!\
 n\nFrom exquisite choreography and lavish costumes to Tchaikovsky’s icon
 ic score\, it’s an extraordinarily rich\, family-friendly holiday experi
 ence!\n\nElevate Your Evening with VIP Tickets: Upgrade to VIP for an excl
 usive backstage tour and an elegant wine-and-charcuterie spread at intermi
 ssion. The perfect touch to make your Nutcracker night truly magical.
LOCATION:Spreckels Center for the Performing Arts
URL:https://spreckelsonline.com/special-event/dance-evolution-studios-nutc
 racker/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
