DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T140000
UID:2611127plzPeq6T0OA9L5Uj-JfUg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to roll up and stretch out! Club Pilates is coming t
 o The Lounge at Mercy on Saturday\, December 19th for an all-levels mat Pi
 lates class!\n\nJoin us for 45 minutes of movement\, mindful stretching\, 
 and feel-good energy in our cozy\, elevated space. Whether you're a Pilate
 s pro or stepping onto the mat for the first time\, this class is designed
  for all experience levels.\n\nBring your mat\, bring a friend\, and get r
 eady to lengthen\, strengthen\, and unwind. Club Pilates will be offering 
 exclusive membership discounts and special packages for attendees\, along 
 with a chance to win fun prizes in their event raffle!\n\nAnd once the wor
 kout is done\, stick around for a post-Pilates sesh! Unwind\, connect with
  fellow attendees\, and enjoy an elevated afternoon at The Lounge.\n\n**Cl
 ass Details:**\n\nSaturday\, December 19th\n\n45-minute all-levels mat Pil
 ates class\n\n$20 per ticket\n\nLimited to 50 participants\n\n***Bring you
 r own mat***\n\n**Ready to get moving? Grab your $20 ticket now and reserv
 e your spot!** Space is limited to 50 participants\, so don't wait to clai
 m your spot.\n\nCome for Pilates\, stay for the sesh. 🌿
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy 
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercy-presents-mat-pilates-hosted-by-club-pi
 lates-rohnert-park-15378
