  and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new s
 ounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n **Bruce Halbohm**\n\nBruce H
 albohm is a talented keyboardist\, composer\, and multi-instrumentalist k
