 bolism\nDiscover why your metabolism changes over time and what you can do
  to support it. Explore the connections between blood sugar\, muscle\, hor
 mones\, sleep and circadian rhythms\, along with practical habits to help 
 you feel more energized and resilient.\nRegister\n2026-2027 Schedule:\nNov
  11: Immune Resilience Through The Decades\nDec 9: The Food-Mood Connectio
 n for Nervous System Health\nJan 13: Supporting Your Changing Metabolism\n
