BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Californiabluegrass": "https://californiabluegrass.org/event/garage-jam/2027-01-18/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:californiabluegrass
X-SOURCE:California Bluegrass Association
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T180000
DTSTAMP:20260303T231826Z
CREATED:20260303T231826Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260303T231826Z
UID:344902-1800295200-1800295200@californiabluegrass.org
SUMMARY:Garage Jam
DESCRIPTION:The Garage Jam is an open\, friendly bluegrass circle that meets the first and third Monday of every month\, from 6 to 8 pm. All kinds of pickers show up\, from rank beginners to grizzled veterans\, plus folks who just come to listen and socialize. The repertoire is straight-up traditional bluegrass\, although the occasional old-time or folk-inflected choice will pop up. The format is the old-fashioned song circle\, with each participant getting a turn to call a song and set its key\, pace\, and feel. An experienced jam leader and bass player are always present to help keep things on track. Everyone is welcome — come on down!
URL:https://californiabluegrass.org/event/garage-jam/2027-01-18/
LOCATION:Out West Garage\, 321 Second Street\, Petaluma\, 94952\, United States
CATEGORIES:Jam
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://californiabluegrass.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20210607_192219.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce": "https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/infant-cpr-and-safety-class-for-parents-01-18-2027"}
X-SOURCE-ID:growthzone_sebastopol
SUMMARY:Infant CPR and Safety Class for Parents
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T203000
UID:04b09e95b5cf1bfd47a2262f979102af@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new or expecting parent who wants to know how to res
 pond if your baby experiences a cardiac\, breathing\, choking\, or other m
 edical emergency? This class is designed for parents and anyone who cares 
 for or spends time around infants. Our Infant CPR for Parents class covers
  CPR\, first aid\, choking treatment\, injury prevention\, and emergency r
 esponse for newborns and infants up to 1 year old. You’ll learn how to r
 educe common safety risks\, what to do in an emergency\, who to call\, whe
 re to go\, and how to help while waiting for paramedics. Learn from a top-
 rated\, local CPR training company with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our cl
 asses are fun\, engaging\, and expertly taught by professional first respo
 nders. Ideal for new and expecting parents\, family members\, friends\, ba
 bysitters\, nannies\, caregivers\, teachers\, employees\, personal assista
 nts\, and others who want to confidently respond to infant emergencies. Le
 arn More & Enroll: https://vivecpr.com/class/infant-cpr-for-parents/
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/infant-cpr-and-safety-c
 lass-for-parents-01-18-2027
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
