DESCRIPTION:fromBrighten the winter season with a little handmade glow! In
  this one-day workshop\, you’ll create a small wintertime luminaria. Pai
 nting in a limited palette of transparent acrylic colors you’ll stain ar
 t tissue paper to create a 2-sided collage on vellum paper. Using your ima
 gination\, you can embellish with pens and then shape it into a charming l
 ittle light to display on a shelf or tabletop. Bring color\, creativity\, 
 and warmth to the shorter days of winter. Some art experience is helpful.
LOCATION:Room 208\, 276 East Napa Street\, Sonoma\, CA
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/collaged-luminaria/
