SUMMARY:Navigating AB 1572 for HOA and Commercial Properties
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270128T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270128T113000
UID:4d883386e36c8e919c281c4a7896440e@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you prepared for the new nonfunctional turf irrigation reg
 ulations? California law AB 1572 prohibits irrigating nonfunctional lawn w
 ith potable water for Homeowners Association (HOA) common areas\, and comm
 ercial\, industrial\, and institutional properties. If you're an HOA or co
 mmercial property manager or decision maker in Sonoma or Marin counties\, 
 join the Sonoma-Marin Saving Water Partnership for a FREE event on Thursda
 y\, January 28\, 2027 at the Petaluma Community Center from 9am-11:30am to
LOCATION:Petaluma Community Center\, 320 N McDowell Blvd.\, Petaluma\, CA 
 94954
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/navigating-ab-1572-for-hoa-and-c
 ommercial-properties/
X-SOURCE:Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
