DESCRIPTION:Purchase tickets at <a href="http://rfo.simpletix.com" target=
 "_blank">rfo.simpletix.com</a>.<br>Presentations on astronomical topics ar
 e given in the classroom throughout the course of the evening. Starting at
  dusk\, the Observatory’s three main telescopes are open for your viewin
 g. Docents set up additional telescopes in front of the building. Friendly
  and knowledgeable docents are available to answer your questions. $18.00 
 per adult\; $15.00 for seniors 62+\, $12 for students\; $7 youth 6 to 12\;
  5 and under FREE. (Plus State Park Parking Fee $10.00 per vehicle.) <br>
 <u></u><u></u>
