DESCRIPTION:fromLearn all the essential techniques of embroidery and creat
 e your very own stitch sampler project. This class covers all the basics i
 n embroidery. Learn how to select fabrics\, set up your hoop\, transfer pa
 tterns and master fundamental stitches (running\, backstitch\, satin and F
 rench knot). All supplies and patterns will be provided. You will have you
 r own project\, hoop\, needle\, and some thread to take home to continue y
