X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sonoma Community Center": "https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/the-art-of-becoming-awakening-creativity-from-within/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sonoma_community_center
SUMMARY:The Art of Becoming: Awakening Creativity from Within
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270205T130000
UID:tribe-28490@sonomacommunitycenter.org
DESCRIPTION:fromInner Portraitinvites you to rediscover the joy of playful
  self-expression. In this welcoming\, all-levels class\, we explore gentle
  embodied awareness\, guided meditation\, and imaginative exercises that a
 waken creativity from within. Through movement\, drawing\, painting\, coll
 age\, writing\, and reflection\, your inner experience naturally takes for
